// Title: AWS SecurityHub Findings Evasion
// ID: a607e1fe-74bf-4440-a3ec-b059b9103157
// Status: stable
// Level: high
// Author: Sittikorn S
// Date: 2021-06-28
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects the modification of the findings on SecurityHub.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(eventSource EQ "securityhub.amazonaws.com" AND (eventName EQ "BatchUpdateFindings" OR eventName EQ "DeleteInsight" OR eventName EQ "UpdateFindings" OR eventName EQ "UpdateInsight"))
